Just purchased a beat on Beat22 but didn’t get your download files? Don’t worry, it’s usually a simple issue, and we’ll help you get your files quickly. Here’s what might have happened and how to fix it: **1\. Check Your Email** As soon as you complete your purchase, we automatically send your:

-   Beat file (MP3 / WAV / Stems)
-   License agreement PDF
-   Invoice and receipt

**Check your inbox and spam/junk folder** for an email from **Beat22**. **2\. Check “My Orders” in Your Account** You can always access your purchased files directly from your Beat22 account: **Steps:**

1.  Log in to your account at [beat22.com](https://beat22.com)
2.  Click **“Browse”** at the top
3.  Select **“My Orders”** from the dropdown
4.  Click on your purchased beat
5.  Download your media file, license, and receipt

**3\. Order Still Showing “Pending”?** If your order status still shows **“Pending”**, it means your payment hasn’t fully processed yet. In this case, wait a few minutes, most issues resolve within a short time. If it remains pending after 10–15 minutes, contact us. **4\. Still Not Received Anything?** Sometimes there may be:

-   A **network delay**
-   A **technical error**
-   Or a rare case where payment went through but the files didn’t trigger

Just email us at **support@beat22.com** with:

-   A **screenshot of your payment**
-   Your **order number**
-   The **name of the beat**

We’ll verify and send your files manually ASAP. **Our Promise** We want every buyer to have a smooth experience. If something goes wrong, we’ll fix it fast and make sure you get everything you paid for.
